1
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:08,400
Can the greatest romance of your life last only one night?

2
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:10,800
Before Sunrise is a drama, romance film directed by Richard Linklater.

3
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:13,200
An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to
spend an evening wandering through Vienna.

4
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:15,600
As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas
while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.

5
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:18,000
Jesse, played by Ethan Hawke.

6
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:20,400
Céline, played by Julie Delpy.

7
00:28:16,799 --> 00:28:22,799
Wife on Train, played by Andrea Eckert.

8
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:25,200
Husband on Train, played by Hanno Pöschl.

9
00:36:21,599 --> 00:36:27,599
Guy on Bridge, played by Karl Bruckschwaiger.

10
00:40:24,000 --> 00:40:30,000
Guy on Bridge, played by Tex Rubinowitz.

11
00:44:26,400 --> 00:44:32,400
Before Sunrise is a 1995 romantic drama film directed by Richard Linklater and co-written by
Linklater and Kim Krizan, and is the first installment in the Before trilogy.

12
00:48:28,800 --> 00:48:34,800
In the film, Jesse (Ethan Hawke) and Céline (Julie Delpy) meet on a
train and disembark in Vienna to spend the night together.

13
00:52:31,200 --> 00:52:37,200
Inspired by personal experiences, Linklater collaborated with Krizan, who previously appeared in his
films Slacker (1991) and Dazed and Confused (1993), to develop the film's screenplay.

14
00:56:33,599 --> 00:56:39,599
Casting was extensive; it took nine months for Hawke and Delpy to be cast.

15
01:00:36,000 --> 01:00:42,000
Principal photography took place in Vienna.

16
01:04:38,400 --> 01:04:44,400
The plot is considered minimalistic, consisting mostly of
monologues and extended dialogue between the characters.

17
01:08:40,800 --> 01:08:46,800
The film explores themes and differing perspectives on life, love,
time, death, self-discovery, and postmodern romance.

18
01:12:43,199 --> 01:12:49,199
Before Sunrise premiered at the Sundance Film Festival on January 19, 1995, and
was theatrically released in the United States eight days later.

19
01:16:45,600 --> 01:16:51,600
It grossed $22.5 million and received critical acclaim, particularly for its
screenplay, Linklater's direction, and acting performances.

20
01:20:48,000 --> 01:20:54,000
Before Sunrise appeared on many critics' lists of
the greatest films of the year.

21
01:24:50,400 --> 01:24:56,400
Retrospectively, the film received a rating of 100% on Rotten Tomatoes.

22
01:28:52,800 --> 01:28:58,800
The sequel Before Sunset was released in 2004, and Before
Midnight, the third film, was released in 2013.

23
01:32:55,199 --> 01:33:01,199
The film explores themes of talking, soulmates,
walking, austria, vienna, austria.

24
01:36:57,600 --> 01:37:03,600
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
